+                 * observed to land (rd matches) with the PLM open.
+                 *
+                 *   CmpXp3g      1 = enable
+                 *   CmpXp3gSlot  slot index 0-3, default 3
+                 *   CmpXp3gOvr   OVR mask,  default 0xffffffff
+                 *   CmpXp3gVal   VAL value, default 0x00200000 (A100)
+                 */
