+                /* ===== BEGIN GEN3_PUBSWEEP =====
+                 * Map which bits the cap-publish path at 0x8872c will actually
+                 * let through into LnkCap2.
+                 *
+                 * Observed (docs/19): 0x8872c accepts a literal 0xe -- it reads
+                 * back 0xe -- but LnkCap2 stays 0x6. So the model from doc 12,
